            <ArticleTitle>[A woman with an increasing belly size in spite of diet].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>A3378</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 44-year old women presented with a increasing abdomen and mild pain since several months. In surgery a cystic fibrothecoma of the ovary of 10 kg was removed. Fibrothecoma's are rare benign tumours of the ovaries. These tumours rarely grow this big.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
